                <td>      
                        <ul>
  <li>Eligibility for Redemption: The e-coupon can be redeemed either after signing the agreement or before the registration process.</li>
  <li>Restrictions on Use: The e-coupon cannot be used at the time of booking or towards the booking advance.</li>
  <li>Single Use Per Plot: Only one e-coupon can be applied per plot purchase.</li>
  <li>Applicability: The e-coupon is valid only for new plot purchases and cannot be used for already purchased plots.</li>
  <li>Redemption Requirement: To redeem, the original e-coupon code must be presented. Screenshots, tampered, or invalid codes will not be accepted.</li>
