  <li>Transferability: The e-coupon is transferable and may be used by family or friends of the original recipient. However, the registered coupon holder must be present during redemption, or an authorization email must be sent to delight@gsquarehousing.com at least 4 days prior to booking. Each e-coupon can be transferred only once; multiple transfers are not permitted.</li>
  <li>No Cash Value: The e-coupon has no cash value and cannot be exchanged for cash.</li>
  <li>Limitation of Liability: G Square is not liable for lost, shared, stolen, or misused e-coupons. No replacement or refund will be issued in such cases.</li>
  <li>Validity: The e-coupon will be valid only if it carries the authorized digital validation. Any tampered or invalid e-coupon will be void.</li>
  <li>Expiry: The e-coupon is valid for one year from the date of issuance.</li>
  <li>Customer Support: For queries or assistance, please contact us at 91500 68610 or email delight@gsquarehousing.com.</li>
  <li>Dispute Resolution: All disputes related to this e-coupon will fall under the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Chennai only.</li>
</ul>

